<div class="container ddo">
  <div class="title">
    <span><b><h2>1. Expected Delivery Time </h2></b></span>
      <span><b>SHIPS TO</b></span>
      <span><p><b class="ml-20">1.  North India :</b></p></span>
      <span><p>Standard Delivery : 4-5 Days</p></span>
      <span><p>Expedited Delivery : 2-3 Days (24-48 Hours for Metro Cities)</p></span>
      <span><p><b class="ml-20">2.  East India :</b></p></span>
      <span><p>Standard Delivery : 5-7 Days</p></span>
      <span><p>Expedited Delivery : 2-3 Days (24-48 Hours for Metro Cities)</p></span>
       <span><p><b class="ml-20">3. West India : </b></p></span>
      <span><p>Standard Delivery : 2-3 Days</p></span>
      <span><p>Expedited Delivery : 24-48 Hours</p></span>
       <span><p><b class="ml-20">4. South India :</b></p></span>
      <span><p>Standard Delivery : 4-5 Days</p></span>
      <span><p>Expedited Delivery : 2-3 Days (24-48 Hours for Metro Cities)</p></span>
       <span><p><b class="ml-20">5.  Andaman & Nicobar /Laksadweep Islands :</b></p></span>
      <span><p>Standard Delivery : 10-12 Days</p></span>
      <span><p>Expedited Delivery : 5-7 Days</p></span>
      <br><br>
      <span><p>*Due to COVID-19 shipping times may vary. </p></span>
      <span><p>You will receive an email which will contain the tracking link once your order has been shipped!</p></span>
  </div>

   <div class="title">
    <span><b><h2>2. Locations Ships To</h2></b></span>
      <span><p>We ship <b>All over india & Governed Islands</b>.</p></span>
      <span><p>Buyers from Countries Other than India are requested to Drop an email with their contact details to us before placing an order.</p></span>
   </div>
      
   <div class="title">
    <span><b><h2>3. Shipping Methods and Prices</h2></b></span>
      <span><p>Carriers: Here are a variety of logistics carriers we use to ship products to our customers. Like Bluedart, FedEx,Delhivery,Expressbees,Ecom Express,Ekart Logistics,India Post, etc. We will choose according to the items and your needs.</p></span>
      <span><b class="ml-20">Shipping fee: </b></span>
      <br>
      <span><p><b>STANDARD SHIPPING: Free</b></p></span>
      <span><p>Ship by road through local logistics such as Delhivery,Expressbees,Ecom Express,Ekart Logistics,India Post etc.</p></span>
      <span><p><b>EXPEDITED SHIPPING: 199 INR</b></p></span>
      <span><p>Ship by AIR through logistics such as Bluedart, FedEx,Delhivery,Expressbees,Ecom Express, speed post etc. Choose it if you have special needs for time!</p></span>
   </div> 

  <div class="title">
    <span><b><h2>4. Shipping from</h2></b></span>  
    <span><p>We have two shipping warehouses: Gujarat and New Delhi Warehouse.</p></span>
    <span><p>The shipping warehouse may change due to the destination and product inventory.</p></span>
  </div>

  <div class="title">
    <span><b><h2>5. Payment Methods</h2></b></span>  
    <span><p>We accept all major credit cards (including Visa, MasterCard,Rupay & American Express,), Net Banking, UPI, Paytm Wallet. We also provide Cash on delivery option to our beloved customers. Please note that cash on delivery option is subject to availability at delivery location.</p></span>
  </div>

  <div class="title">
    <span><b><h2>6. Exclude Duties & shipping for international orders</h2></b></span>  
    <span><p>All international orders are subject to customs and duty fees as defined by the country of import. These fees are not included in your order and shipping total. Himster assumes no responsibility for duties incurred on discounted or promotional items. All fees must be paid by the parcel recipient. Any item that is returned because the customer not paying customs duties will not be able to process for the refund.</p></span>
    <span><p>By placing an order, you authorize Himster to import your product on your behalf and agree to Himster delegating the import of your products to a third party. Unfortunately, we are unable to provide information on whether you may or may not be charged customs/duty fees. Duties will be determined by the country of import upon arrival of your order based off product value.</p></span>
  </div>

  <div class="title">
    <span><b><h2>7. Tracking Your Order</h2></b></span>  
    <span><p>Once your order has shipped and the carrier has generated a tracking number, you will be emailed the tracking information. Tracking information is available within your account. Few international orders will not guarantee tracking after they arrival the destination country.</p></span>
  </div>  

  <div class="title">
    <span><b><h2>8. Handling time</h2></b></span>  
    <span><p>Our products usually ship within 1-2 business days (do NOT include weekends or holidays). Please be patient my friend, sometimes it will take about few days to be processed by the logistics. </p></span>
    <span><p>We strive to get all orders received before 10.00 AM (Indian Standard Time) shipped out the same (business) day. We ship from our warehouses in Gujarat and New Delhi and depending on our inventory and your location. We will contact you if for some reason there are any delays. Once the tracking number is available, you will receive a shipping confirmation via email! </p></span>
    <span><p>If you have any shipping concerns please mail us at <b>store@himster.in</b> for assistance.</p></span>
  </div>  

